# AGENTS.md maintenance

- When creating a new relevant directory under `src/`, `demo/`, `tests/`, `plans/`, or `spikes/`, add an `AGENTS.md` with: Purpose, Belongs here, Does not belong here, Depends on, Used by
- When moving or renaming layers, update affected `AGENTS.md` files in the same change
- Keep each `AGENTS.md` under 100 lines, point form only — no essays, no duplicate README content
- Describe **directory boundaries and placement rules**, not inventories of every class or file — agents can read the code for that
- Do not add `AGENTS.md` to `.gitignore`, `node_modules/`, `dist/`, or other non-application dirs
- Prefer updating an existing `AGENTS.md` over letting it go stale
- Root `AGENTS.md` is the package map; directory files own local boundaries only
